            "review_text": "Mervyn33\nSingapore, Singapore353 contributions\n0\nNew food adventure trip this round\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nWell I will give it a “ 5 “ comparing to some other I tried … Chilli Thai at Ly Tu Trong is one of the best Thai restaurants in HCMC.\nWe ordered the Tomyum Soup with Seafoods, it was really good with fresh seafoods. The stir-fried River Prawn with Glass Noodle, Crab paste sauce was perfect combination .. the glass noodle was well fried … we wanted to try the Laeng saeb look good but we didn’t try it \nFor dessert, I had the sticky rice that come with durian coconut milk … was great\nRead more\nWritten February 4, 2026",
