            "review_text": "ruud nl\nHelmond, The Netherlands384 contributions\n0\nFood good, service business, customer friendly bad: no napkins available, only disposable wet cloth for a fee.\nMay 2025 • Couples\nThe food was delicious, green and red curry and stir-fried white cabbage. Starter fishcakes more than good. Mango smoothie very tasty. Yet only 3/5 score. Even now no napkins available ( policy owner ). You can buy moist, soap-scented wipes. We ate shrimp that are unpeeled in the curry. You do have to peel with your hands but after taking them off, they are rich in soap. Turn it off. Manager heard it but she didn't do anything else. Tip : on toilet hangs paper, which can be used as a napkin.\nRead more\nTranslated from Dutch\nShow original\nWritten May 4, 2025",
