            "review_text": "daniel s\nStockholm, Sweden10 contributions\n0\nPay for napkins\nJan 2025 • Family\nWe walked around looking for a place to have lunch. It was Vietnamese New Year so most of it was closed. We almost understood that it would be useless but when we asked for napkins they wanted extra payment for it. One of the dishes we got was wrong and the dish we got was more expensive than the one we ordered. When we paid, they had no change but solved it practically by rounding in their favor.\nRead more\nTranslated from Swedish\nShow original\nWritten January 28, 2025",
