            "review_text": "NWMale12345\nManchester, United Kingdom128 contributions\n0\nPoor Anniversary Meal.\nJun 2023 • Couples\nWe selected this place to eat to celebrate 27 years of marriage. It's a good job I didn't take my wife here on the first date otherwise we would not be together.\nHaving ordered drinks and the meals, the drinks came. It wasn't what we ordered. I asked them to change them, and the waitress went away and then came back with the same drinks telling me I had ordered them. I explained it wasn't what we ordered, and why would I order a drinks I do not like ? She continued to argue with me, I then stood up and went to leave. She told me to sit down and our drinks would come. They did eventually, but why argue ?\nThe food turned up. I had eaten my meal well before my wifes' arrived. I think this was done on purpose.\nThe main course was ok, however the starters were poor and cold.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 3, 2023",
